					]
				},
				{
					"id": "tnMl1_I9kEy47og_C",
					"name": "Genetic Absorption",
					"local_notes": "No per-meal stat change. Over a campaign a kindred that has eaten a strong enemy's flesh may gain a small trait (GM's call and story-driven); Shapers guide which.\n\nLore: Kroot absorb genetic traits from the flesh they eat: over generations a kindred takes on the strengths of what it kills. Codex: T'au Empire background.\n\nDesign: A 0-point feature at the kindred level, per framework.md's direction: not a mechanical per-meal effect but a story lever.",
					"tags": [
						"Feature",
						"Xenos",
						"T'au",
						"Kroot"
					],
					"base_points": 0
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "TH1M0HKV05YqPDJSx",
			"name": "Kroot Kindred",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Kroot live and fight in kindreds: extended clans that move as a body, led by a Shaper, who hire out to the T'au for payment and the chance to eat the strong. Kroot eating habits, including eating the slain, are the most commented-on thing about them. Codex: T'au Empire background.\n\nDesign: Sense of Duty (Kindred) -5 + Odious Personal Habit -5 = -10 points.",
			"tags": [
				"Disadvantage",
				"Mental",
				"Xenos",
				"T'au",
				"Kroot"
			],
			"container_type": "meta_trait",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tgQj4UuKReZCDsrNl",
					"name": "Sense of Duty (Kindred)",
					"reference": "B153",
					"local_notes": "Will not leave kin behind or betray the kindred; self-control roll to put self first.\n\nLore: A Kroot's loyalty is to the kindred first.\n\nDesign: Sense of Duty (B153), Small Group -5.",
					"tags": [
						"Disadvantage",
						"Mental",
						"Xenos",
						"T'au",
						"Kroot"
					],
					"modifiers": [
						{
							"id": "m5EubNT2MjsGeayiT",
							"name": "Small Group (the kindred)",
							"reference": "B153",
							"cost_adj": "-5"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "tkJKBkj9Qvleli7Lc",
					"name": "Odious Personal Habit (Eats the Slain)",
					"reference": "B22",
					"local_notes": "-1 reaction from those who find it disgusting (most non-Kroot, including many T'au).\n\nLore: Kroot eat their kills, including the dead of other species.\n\nDesign: Odious Personal Habit 1 level (B22, -5/level) = -5 points.",
					"tags": [
						"Disadvantage",
						"Social",
						"Xenos",
						"T'au",
						"Kroot"
					],
					"points_per_level": -5,
					"can_level": true,
					"levels": 1
				}
			]
		}
	],
